###############################################################################
# HELPER PACKAGES (10)
#
# Purpose:
#   Tooling that *supports* the rest of the system and install process.
#   These make everything else easier, but are not core OS components.
#
# What belongs here:
#   - AUR helpers (yay, paru)
#   - Git
#   - Stow
#   - Downloaders (wget, curl)
#   - CLI utilities used by install scripts
#
# What does NOT belong here:
#   - Daemons or long-running services
#   - Desktop environment components
#   - End-user applications
#
###############################################################################


unzip
stow
go
yay